Academic Project Notice:

This project was developed as part of the Semester project curriculum at Mahindra 
University's Ecole Centrale School of Engineering under the supervision of 
Dr. Neeraj Choudhary.

The system is currently deployed and operational for Mahindra University's 
campus infrastructure monitoring. This repository contains selected documentation 
and code samples for academic and portfolio purposes.

Full implementation details, production configurations, and proprietary machine 
learning models are maintained separately for security and confidentiality.

For inquiries regarding this project, please contact:
- Project Lead: Hriday (SE22UARI056)
- Institution: Mahindra University
